WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,370
With such a good annual salary and such generous remuneration, it is absolutely right to take the initiative.

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,370
Anyway, the good work has been completed.

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:10,370
Oh my God, I have recruited another beauty for the role. I am so happy that I can’t imagine.

4
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:13,940
Sanpi, is this beauty beautiful?

5
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,940
Beautiful anchor Liu Qingsi, can she not be beautiful?

6
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:18,940
Do I often watch her live broadcasts, or am I just a big fan of hers?

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:19,940
Why did you post her photo?

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,940
Let me tell you a big news. From now on, Liu Qing will no longer live broadcast, but will be recruited by Zhang Tong.

9
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:23,940
What nonsense are you talking about?

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,940
It's absolutely true, from now on she will work by Zhang Tong's side along with the joke photos.

11
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,940
Zhang Tong offered her an annual salary of three million.

12
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,940
You said Zhang Tong recruited Zhao Qian and Liu Qingsi at the same time?

13
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,940
Yes! I lied to you, I am a grandson! Get out!

14
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,940
It makes you, a wretched fat man, talk nonsense, it's so boring!

15
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,940
Why am I talking nonsense?

16
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:39,940
Brother has been hinting to you, asking you to come over and hug his thighs together, but you don’t believe it?

17
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:42,980
He Kaichao had already posted the photo of Zhang Tong driving a four-wheeler selling fruit on the roadside.

18
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,980
There are two beauties around me, do you think I am a three-year-old child?

19
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:47,980
This bragging is so unbelievable that fool Yang Bo actually believed it.

20
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,980
Lack of wealth in destiny means suffering in life.
